This crate reimplements Meson (Apache-2.0, Meson Project, https://mesonbuild.com/).
It is based on Oxidized Meson (MIT, overby-me/oxidized-meson @ 85dc2261c7f8d30007382c8ae0d54d72fc188a5e).
The Apache-2.0 license text in LICENSE-APACHE covers the Meson reimplementation;
the MIT license text in LICENSE-MIT covers the Oxidized codebase. Muon behavior,
commands, and outputs were used as specification only; no GPL code is included.
